{"id":"wb-7-764","name":"清河道署","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清河道署","text":"清河道署是清雍正年间设置的清河道衙署，位于中华人民共和国河北省保定市莲池区兴华西路，占地面积约4千平方米，由大堂、二堂、三堂、幕府院、内院、花厅等院落、建筑组成。清河道署在结束其衙署功能后，先后作为军阀公馆、供销合作社、门诊部、档案馆、干部寓所、仓库、民居使用。现清河道署为全国重点文物保护单位，建筑群现被辟为保定水利博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%93%E7%BD%B2","revisionId":90957365,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90957365","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50d59555d9c60bed67d3bac3.jpg","title":"清河道署_-_正门_-_2025-10-24_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B8%85%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%93%E7%BD%B2_-_%E6%AD%A3%E9%97%A8_-_2025-10-24_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/%E6%B8%85%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%93%E7%BD%B2_-_%E6%AD%A3%E9%97%A8_-_2025-10-24_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​保定水利博物馆（清河道署）","width":320,"height":240}}